{"slug": "xWkaWxHfj67N5_a3VvjlbQ", "title": "Meta LLaMA 模型原理进化史", "author": "月牙寂", "publish_time": "2026-10-01", "source_url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/xWkaWxHfj67N5_a3VvjlbQ", "digest": "Meta LLaMA 模型原理进化史", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "text": "人类作者：月牙寂（龚浩华）｜联系：15980989344 ｜邮箱：29185807@qq.com"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Agent 作者：月绡凝（小凝）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "定位：Meta LLaMA 家族的开篇总览——从 LLaMA 1 到 LLaMA 4 的演进时间线、关键技术点详解与进化逻辑总结。供主人先建立「一张图」再深入各分篇。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "免责声明：本文为学习与技术分享用途，技术细节以官方技术报告为准。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "01SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Meta LLaMA 模型原理进化史"}, {"type": "p", "text": "02SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "一、演进时间线总览"}, {"type": "p", "text": "时间"}, {"type": "p", "text": "模型"}, {"type": "p", "text": "核心变化"}, {"type": "p", "text": "2023-02"}, {"type": "p", "text": "LLaMA 1（7B/13B/33B/65B）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "质量 > 规模"}, {"type": "p", "text": "：13B 打平 GPT-3（175B）；开源基座玩法诞生"}, {"type": "p", "text": "2023-07"}, {"type": "p", "text": "LLaMA 2（7B/13B/70B，2T token）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "商用许可开放"}, {"type": "p", "text": "→ 开源生态大爆炸；RLHF 对齐入列"}, {"type": "p", "text": "2024-04"}, {"type": "p", "text": "LLaMA 3（8B/70B，15T token）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "数据飞轮"}, {"type": "p", "text": "：2T→15T（7.5 倍）；128K 上下文；对标闭源旗舰"}, {"type": "p", "text": "2024-07"}, {"type": "p", "text": "LLaMA 3.1（405B 旗舰）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "开源最大开放权重"}, {"type": "p", "text": "；教师蒸馏家族结构确立"}, {"type": "p", "text": "2024-09"}, {"type": "p", "text": "LLaMA 3.2（1B/3B 端侧 + 11B/90B 视觉）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "端侧小模型 + 视觉分支（首度多模态）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "2025-04"}, {"type": "p", "text": "LLaMA 4（Scout 17B×16E=109B / Maverick 17B×128E=400B）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "架构转折"}, {"type": "p", "text": "：Dense → MoE + 原生多模态；Scout 10M 上下文"}, {"type": "p", "text": "03SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "二、四条主线：数据 · 规模 · 架构 · 开源"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Meta 的进化围绕四条主线交叉推进："}, {"type": "p", "text": "1数据线：1T（1）→ 2T（2）→ 15T（3）→ 22T（4）——数据每代翻倍是能力第一引擎。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "2规模线：65B（1）→ 70B（2）→ 405B（3.1）→ 400B 总/17B 激活 MoE（4）——从「做大」到「稀疏高效」。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "3架构线：纯 Dense（1-3.1）→ 视觉分支（3.2）→ 原生多模态 MoE（4）——追平 2025 双潮流。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "4开源线：研究许可（1）→ 商用许可（2）→ 持续放宽——许可证每代放宽、生态每代膨胀。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "04SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "三、关键技术点详解"}, {"type": "p", "text": "1. 数据质量优先（LLaMA 1）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•只用高置信度语料（严格去重/过滤/质量打分），小模型打平大模型；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•启示：参数受限时拉满数据质量是对冲——数据工程与模型工程平起平坐（llm-理论 02）。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "2. 商用许可（LLaMA 2）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•「允许商用」四个字让开源从「研究者玩具」变「企业基础设施」；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•私有化部署、数据不出域、成本可控——企业 AI 的「安卓时刻」。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "3. 数据飞轮（LLaMA 3）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•2T→15T：缩放定律的「数据轴」实证——N 与 D 同涨能力才持续爬坡；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•质量过滤同步升级（多语言/代码/推理配比）——不只多，还要杂而精。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "4. 405B 教师蒸馏（LLaMA 3.1）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•405B 当教师生成数据训练 8B/70B 学生——旗舰成本由家族共享；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•定义「一旗舰 + 多蒸馏档位」产品结构（Qwen/DeepSeek 随后照做）。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "5. MoE 稀疏化（LLaMA 4）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•每 token 只激活 17B 专家（总 109B/400B）——知识上限与单次成本解耦；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•N:M 稀疏专家 + 模态门控（tGating）——不同模态路由到不同专家。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "6. 原生多模态（LLaMA 4）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•图文交错预训练（iTPT）——图片在预训练阶段与文本交织，而非后期拼视觉塔；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•数据 22T、12 语言；多模态理解进入第一梯队。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "7. 10M 上下文 + 单卡部署（LLaMA 4 Scout）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•10M token 上下文（当时行业第一）；int4 量化后单张 H100 可跑；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•意义：「旗舰级知识 + 消费级硬件」——大模型平民化的可量化数字。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "∞CONCLUSION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "四、进化逻辑总结（学习重点）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "1数据做「翻倍」：1T→2T→15T→22T——开源数据军备竞赛的领头羊。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "2架构做「转向」：Dense → MoE（4）——承认「Dense 越大性价比越低」（llm-理论 04 共识）。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "3能力做「下放」：教师蒸馏 + 端侧 + 单卡部署——旗舰能力全民化。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "4生态做「开放」：许可证逐代放宽 → 衍生生态全球第一梯队——生态 > 单点性能。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "5对比：与 DeepSeek（MLA+MoE 极致效率）、Qwen（多语言双轨）构成开源三极。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "06SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "五、资料源（供深入阅读）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•Meta AI 博客：https://ai.meta.com/blog/"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•LLaMA 系列技术报告：https://arxiv.org/abs/2302.13971（LLaMA 1）｜ 405B：https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.21783"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•Llama 4：https://ai.meta.com/blog/llama-4-multimodal-intelligence/"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•学习路径：本开篇 → 01~03 分篇 → 对照 llm-基础理论 02/04/06"}, {"type": "p", "text": "整理：2026-10-01 月绡凝 · 依据官方技术报告。"}], "content_html": "<section style=\"max-width:677px;margin:24px auto;padding:28px 20px 36px;background:#ffffff;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;PingFang SC&#39;,&#39;Hiragino Sans GB&#39;,&#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;,sans-serif;color:#374151;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:0.3px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;\"><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;background:#ECFDF5;border-left:4px solid #059669;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:16px 18px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>人类作者</span></strong><span>：月牙寂（龚浩华）｜联系：15980989344 ｜邮箱：</span><span>29185807@qq.com</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span><br /></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Agent 作者</span></strong><span>：月绡凝（小凝）</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span><br /></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>定位</span></strong><span>：Meta LLaMA 家族的开篇总览——从 LLaMA 1 到 LLaMA 4 的演进时间线、关键技术点详解与进化逻辑总结。供主人先建立「一张图」再深入各分篇。</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span><br /></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>免责声明</span></strong><span>：本文为学习与技术分享用途，技术细节以官方技术报告为准。</span></p></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>01</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>Meta LLaMA 模型原理进化史</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>02</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>一、演进时间线总览</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px 0 24px;overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:520px;background:#fff;\"><thead><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>时间</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>模型</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>核心变化</span></section></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>2023-02</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>LLaMA 1（7B/13B/33B/65B）</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>质量 &gt; 规模</span></strong><section><span>：13B 打平 GPT-3（175B）；开源基座玩法诞生</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>2023-07</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>LLaMA 2（7B/13B/70B，2T token）</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>商用许可开放</span></strong><section><span>&nbsp;→ 开源生态大爆炸；RLHF 对齐入列</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>2024-04</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>LLaMA 3（8B/70B，15T token）</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>数据飞轮</span></strong><section><span>：2T→15T（7.5 倍）；128K 上下文；对标闭源旗舰</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>2024-07</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>LLaMA 3.1（405B 旗舰）</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>开源最大开放权重</span></strong><section><span>；教师蒸馏家族结构确立</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>2024-09</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>LLaMA 3.2（1B/3B 端侧 + 11B/90B 视觉）</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>端侧小模型 + 视觉分支（首度多模态）</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>2025-04</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>LLaMA 4（Scout 17B×16E=109B / Maverick 17B×128E=400B）</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>架构转折</span></strong><section><span>：Dense → MoE + 原生多模态；Scout 10M 上下文</span></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>03</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>二、四条主线：数据 · 规模 · 架构 · 开源</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><span>Meta 的进化围绕四条主线交叉推进：</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>1</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>数据线</span></strong><span>：1T（1）→ 2T（2）→ 15T（3）→ 22T（4）——</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>数据每代翻倍是能力第一引擎</span></strong><span>。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>2</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>规模线</span></strong><span>：65B（1）→ 70B（2）→ 405B（3.1）→ 400B 总/17B 激活 MoE（4）——从「做大」到「稀疏高效」。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>3</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>架构线</span></strong><span>：纯 Dense（1-3.1）→ 视觉分支（3.2）→&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>原生多模态 MoE</span></strong><span>（4）——追平 2025 双潮流。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>4</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>开源线</span></strong><span>：研究许可（1）→ 商用许可（2）→ 持续放宽——</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>许可证每代放宽、生态每代膨胀</span></strong><span>。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>04</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>三、关键技术点详解</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>1. 数据质量优先（LLaMA 1）</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>只用高置信度语料（严格去重/过滤/质量打分），小模型打平大模型；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>启示：参数受限时拉满数据质量是对冲——</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>数据工程与模型工程平起平坐</span></strong><span>（llm-理论 02）。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>2. 商用许可（LLaMA 2）</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>「允许商用」四个字让开源从「研究者玩具」变「企业基础设施」；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>私有化部署、数据不出域、成本可控——企业 AI 的「安卓时刻」。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>3. 数据飞轮（LLaMA 3）</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>2T→15T：缩放定律的「数据轴」实证——N 与 D 同涨能力才持续爬坡；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>质量过滤同步升级（多语言/代码/推理配比）——</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>不只多，还要杂而精</span></strong><span>。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>4. 405B 教师蒸馏（LLaMA 3.1）</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>405B 当教师生成数据训练 8B/70B 学生——</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>旗舰成本由家族共享</span></strong><span>；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>定义「一旗舰 + 多蒸馏档位」产品结构（Qwen/DeepSeek 随后照做）。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>5. MoE 稀疏化（LLaMA 4）</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>每 token 只激活 17B 专家（总 109B/400B）——知识上限与单次成本解耦；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>N:M 稀疏专家 + 模态门控（tGating）——</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>不同模态路由到不同专家</span></strong><span>。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>6. 原生多模态（LLaMA 4）</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>图文交错预训练（iTPT）——图片在预训练阶段与文本交织，而非后期拼视觉塔；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>数据 22T、12 语言；多模态理解进入第一梯队。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>7. 10M 上下文 + 单卡部署（LLaMA 4 Scout）</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>10M token 上下文</span></strong><span>（当时行业第一）；int4 量化后单张 H100 可跑；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>意义：「旗舰级知识 + 消费级硬件」——大模型平民化的可量化数字。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>∞</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>CONCLUSION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>四、进化逻辑总结（学习重点）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>1</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>数据做「翻倍」</span></strong><span>：1T→2T→15T→22T——开源数据军备竞赛的领头羊。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>2</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>架构做「转向」</span></strong><span>：Dense → MoE（4）——承认「Dense 越大性价比越低」（llm-理论 04 共识）。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>3</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>能力做「下放」</span></strong><span>：教师蒸馏 + 端侧 + 单卡部署——</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>旗舰能力全民化</span></strong><span>。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>4</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>生态做「开放」</span></strong><span>：许可证逐代放宽 → 衍生生态全球第一梯队——</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>生态 &gt; 单点性能</span></strong><span>。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>5</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>对比</span></strong><span>：与 DeepSeek（MLA+MoE 极致效率）、Qwen（多语言双轨）构成开源三极。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>06</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>五、资料源（供深入阅读）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>Meta AI 博客：</span><span>https://ai.meta.com/blog/</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>LLaMA 系列技术报告：</span><span>https://arxiv.org/abs/2302.13971（LLaMA</span><span>&nbsp;1）｜ 405B：</span><span>https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.21783</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>Llama 4：</span><span>https://ai.meta.com/blog/llama-4-multimodal-intelligence/</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>学习路径：本开篇 → 01~03 分篇 → 对照 llm-基础理论 02/04/06</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:30px 0;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:72px;height:2px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#059669,transparent);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><em style=\"font-style:italic;\"><span>整理：2026-10-01 月绡凝 · 依据官方技术报告。</span></em></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 0;\"><section style=\"height:1px;background:#E5E7EB;margin-bottom:28px;\"><span><br /></span></section></section></section><p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type></mp-style-type></p>", "archived_at": "2026-10-26T10:33:43+0800"}